  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Explanation:\n\nBODMAS RULE:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/337cba09b098a129c60c88ca431dc00f7470bb1b39c1452e8d81688a7d6b6b0e.png] \n\nLet's check each option:\n\nOption 1. +, -, =, ÷, +\n\nGiven equation: (440 * 11) * 85 * 57 * (34 * 3)\n\nAfter replacing the signs, we get:\n\n⇒ __**(440 + 11)**__ - 85 = 57 ÷ __**(34 + 3)**__\n\n⇒ __451** - 85**__ = __**57 ÷ **37__\n\n⇒ 366 ≠ 1.54\n\nOption 2. ×, =, -, ÷, +\n\nGiven equation: (440 * 11) * 85 * 57 * (34 * 3)\n\nAfter replacing the signs, we get:\n\n⇒ __(440 × 11)__ = 85 - 57 ÷ __(34 + 3)__\n\n⇒ 4840 = 85 - __57 ÷ 37__\n\n⇒ 4840 = __**85 - **__**__1.54__**\n\n⇒ 4840 ≠ 83.46\n\nOption 3. +, ×, =, ÷, +\n\nGiven equation: (440 * 11) * 85 * 57 * (34 * 3)\n\nAfter replacing the signs, we get:\n\n⇒ __(440 + 11)__ × 85 = 57 ÷ __(34 + 3)__\n\n⇒ 451 × 85 = __57 ÷ 37__\n\n⇒ 38335 ≠ 1.54\n\nOption 4. ÷, -, =, -, ×\n\nGiven equation: (440 * 11) * 85 * 57 * (34 * 3)\n\nAfter replacing the signs, we get:\n\n⇒ __(440 ÷ 11)__ - 85 = 57 - __(34 × 3)__\n\n⇒ __**40 - 85**__ = __57 - 102__\n\n​⇒ -45 = -45\n\nHence,\"÷, -, =, -, ×\" is the correct answer.",
